One Critical Technical Observation

One recommendation in the remediation playbook should be revisited:

Target State: Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 hybrid certificate chain

For a platform emphasizing enterprise quantum readiness, consider making this algorithm selection policy-driven rather than hard-coded.

For example:

Default Enterprise Profile: ML-DSA-65 + ECDSA P-256 hybrid
High Assurance / Government Profile: ML-DSA-87 + stronger classical pairing where appropriate
Experimental / Lab Profile: Configurable

This makes the report adaptable to different organizational policies and future standards without implying a single universal target.

